# Bouncy Castle (levels/solo/bouncy.txt): the first fling, the shelf, the lid, the chimney; then
# back into the wall cushion to fly the moat flat under the gate, the castle's three floors
# (jump into each end's cushion to be flung up a floor) and the trampolines to the plunger.
